{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10064","headline":"怀素上人草书歌 · 朱逵","name":"怀素上人草书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年出家通宿命，一朝却忆临池圣。\n转腕摧锋增崛崎，秋毫茧纸常相随。\n衡阳客舍来相访，连饮百杯神转王。\n忽闻风里度飞泉，纸落纷纷如跕鸢。\n形容脱略真如助，心思周游在何处。\n笔下惟看激电流，字成只畏盘龙去。\n怪状崩腾若转蓬，飞丝历乱如回风。\n长松老死倚云壁，蹙浪相翻惊海鸿。\n于今年少尚如此，历覩远代无伦比。\n妙绝当动鬼神泣，崔蔡幽魂更心死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱逵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}